ion":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":13,"column":1,"offset":528}}},"raw":"# Anchor Memo Program\r\n\r\nWelcome to your first challenge using the Anchor framework on Solana! Your goal is to **create a simple memo program that logs a message** to the blockchain. This is a great introduction to how instructions work in Anchor.\r\n\r\nThe program only has one instruction and takes in:\r\n\r\n- A `String` input\r\n- No accounts\r\n\r\nThen simply logs this string out using the Anchor `msg!()` macro.\r\n\r\nYour program should also have a program Id of `22222222222222222222222222222222222222222222` to pass the challenge.\r\n","highlightedCode":{}}